    "body": "Yes, I think that'd be good. In particular I think having two separate lines like\r\n\r\n1. Let _outsideKey_ be the result of obtaining a storage key for non-storage purposes given _outside settings_.\r\n2. Let _existingSharedWorkerKey_ be the result of result of obtaining a storage key for non-storage purposes given (something).\r\n\r\nthat would help a lot. And indeed the only way I can think of to do that cleanly is a loop...",
